OL,3,AMPs vote against fresh attempt to
OL,4,Alegalise assisted dying
OL,5,
OL,6,FMPs have voted against proposals to
OL,7,Flegalise assisted dying in England and
OL,8,FWales, bringing the latest effort to
OL,9,Fchange the law to an end.
OL,11,FFollowing a debate in which both sides
OL,12,Fmade emotional speeches, the House of
OL,13,FCommons voted 286 to 270, majority 16,
OL,14,Fagainst the proposed legislation.
OL,16,FThe Terminally Ill Adults (End of Life)
OL,17,FBill would have allowed adults with
OL,18,Ffewer than six months to live to apply
OL,19,Fto be given help to end their own life,
OL,20,Fsubject to certain safeguards.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
